  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 41 new plugins, with official repos gaining 341 stars and 484,228 weekly npm downloads; dsh-desktop (+75) and awesome-dsh-plugin (+41) led growth as the official 0.1.6-alpha.2 release shipped. However, 11,926 of 15,358 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7 days and the health score sits at 38, so activity concentration is worth watching.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>41</b> 个插件，官方仓库星标净增 <b>341</b>，npm 周下载量 <b>484228</b>；增长榜由 dsh-desktop（+<b>75</b>）和 awesome-dsh-plugin（+<b>41</b>）领跑，同时官方发布了 0.1.6-alpha.2。不过 <b>15358</b> 个非 fork 插件中有 <b>11926</b> 个已 7 天无更新，健康分仅 <b>38</b>，建议持续观察活跃度分化。"
